      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to HorrorVale! Your next door neighbors are zombies, reanimated monsters deliver the mail and ghosts hide out in your bathroom. Join Alice as she journeys through the underworld on a quest to save her zombie Dog, Scruffy from strange and unusual monsters that have suddenly invaded the once peaceful town of HorrorVale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HorrorVale is a traditional RPG adventure game inspired by horror, full of unexpected twists and turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/cfede292b2e986c7b8fc9a0145029070.avif?t=1769825257\" width=418 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional turn based combat with a spooky spin! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fantastical story spanning 4 Acts! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 hours of monster bashing, friend collecting, puzzle solving goodness! </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/1166612c10006187527b401f78455267.avif?t=1769825257\" width=415 height=113 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit over 30 unique party members, each with their own abilities and quirks! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared XP across all characters means you're free to experiment as much as possible without fear of lost XP! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to know their personal stories in 60 available sidequests! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and greet countless unique and humorous NPCs!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/9375e0369e92c6f3f53ef5ae3e62a174.avif?t=1769825257\" width=454 height=110 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey through spooky streets, creepy woods, scary bogs, and more! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mysteries behind unusual monsters taking over the valley! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the Underworld's deep history and mythos!</strong></p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to HorrorVale! Your next door neighbors are zombies, reanimated monsters deliver the mail and ghosts hide out in your bathroom. Join Alice as she journeys through the underworld on a quest to save her zombie Dog, Scruffy from strange and unusual monsters that have suddenly invaded the once peaceful town of HorrorVale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HorrorVale is a traditional RPG adventure game inspired by horror, full of unexpected twists and turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/cfede292b2e986c7b8fc9a0145029070.avif?t=1769825257\" width=418 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional turn based combat with a spooky spin! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fantastical story spanning 4 Acts! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 hours of monster bashing, friend collecting, puzzle solving goodness! </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/1166612c10006187527b401f78455267.avif?t=1769825257\" width=415 height=113 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit over 30 unique party members, each with their own abilities and quirks! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared XP across all characters means you're free to experiment as much as possible without fear of lost XP! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to know their personal stories in 60 available sidequests! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and greet countless unique and humorous NPCs!</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1114650/extras/9375e0369e92c6f3f53ef5ae3e62a174.avif?t=1769825257\" width=454 height=110 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey through spooky streets, creepy woods, scary bogs, and more! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mysteries behind unusual monsters taking over the valley! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the Underworld's deep history and mythos!</strong></p></li></ul>",
